I forgot to mention that the postnews.c I posted yesterday requires some
of the other (standard 2.10, I think) sources.  Here is a snippet from
the Makefile showing what's needed:

POBJECTS = postnews.o rextern.o rpathinit.o uname.o
postnews: Makefile $(POBJECTS)
	$(CC) $(CFLAGS) $(LFLAGS) $(POBJECTS) -o postnews

